{
  "description": "Cardio (K90) keeps a duration in whole seconds (1799.5 rounds to 1800, anything above 86400 caps at 86400) and a distance in km rounded to 2 places like a weight (21.0975 is 21.1, anything above 1000 caps at 1000). Zero, a negative, a string or a boolean drops either field, and an exercise's sets, reps, weight and per-side drop out. Every kind of mark is kept, as for an exercise, and the type's fields are details like any other.",
